  bv_unsigned (ev (CH2.retEx E' nx ghosts R2) (nx + q)) = z.
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S70|600;!1,[0!1+\1!2'_T1,^A|10;!4'U2#5#73$b;R2!3+4+0!2'b21#1#5$E';R+Y$nx;R+H$ghosts;R!1+12$R2;R!2'Z!1,[|21;2$q;R+H$z;R+0$H;R!3+42!4'U2#2#43!2'_T1#1$Hq;R!2'b=#3!2'^K2#5$Hz;R!2+^F!2'^M,^A#3!2'^[#3!2'`[!1,^;4!1,^;0!6'?256!6'?2!2'_T1#46!2'd>#4#15#3!2'b>!4'`9#9#8#7#6!2'_E#8#5!6'eN#9#8#7#6#5#2").
